    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "RISK FACTORS An investment by Finward shareholders in First Financial common shares as a result of the exchange of shares of Finward common stock for First Financial common shares in the merger involves certain risks. Certain material risks and uncertainties connected with the merger agreement and transactions contemplated thereby, including the merger and bank merger and ownership of First Financial common shares, are discussed below. In addition, First Financial discusses certain other material risks connected with the ownership of First Financial common shares and with First Financial\u2019s business under the caption entitled \u201cRisk Factors\u201d appearing in its Annual Report on Form 10-K most recently filed with the SEC and may include additional or updated disclosures of such material risks in its subsequent Quarterly Reports on Form 10-Q and Current Reports on Form 8-K that First Financial ",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
